# A project saved before the BDs had sends (sound revision 2: the 909 BD's PAN at 8)
# loads with each PAN moved up two and its motion lane with it, the new sends at none.
wait 300
param 0 0 8 30
lane 0 0 8 3 90
sndrev 2
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound0.0.10 30
expect sound0.0.8 0
expect laneval0.0.10.3 90
expect laneval0.0.8.3 -1
